# EHRI Knowledge Graph Exploration Report

## Overview

This report summarizes the exploration of the EHRI (European Holocaust Research Infrastructure) Knowledge Graph available at `https://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/sparql`. The KG operates as a **single unified graph** (no named graphs detected).

